---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactBand from '../../components/layout/ContactBand.astro';
import { projects } from '../../data/projects';

const project = projects.find((item) => item.slug === 'design-day');
if (!project) throw new Error('Design Day project data is unavailable.');

const processImages = [
  { src: '/assets/projects/design-day/design-day-print-components.jpg', width: 1920, height: 1080, alt: 'Purple components being made on a 3D printer during fabrication.', caption: '3D-printed components during fabrication.' },
  { src: '/assets/projects/design-day/design-day-soldering.jpg', width: 475, height: 1028, alt: 'Hands soldering electronics on a workbench during the team build.', caption: 'Soldering and electronics work during the build.' },
  { src: '/assets/projects/design-day/design-day-bench-test.jpg', width: 1200, height: 912, alt: 'Illuminated components and wiring being tested on a workbench before final assembly.', caption: 'Testing illuminated components and wiring before final assembly.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title={project.title} description={project.premise} canonicalPath={project.route}>
  <article class="design-case">
    <header class="design-hero">
      <div class="design-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">02 · Design Day · Winter 2023</p>
        <p class="design-meta">Beam Buccaneers · Design & prototyping · accessibility-oriented interaction</p>
        <h1>Interactive light-based musical instrument</h1>
        <p class="design-lede">A museum interaction sparked an accessibility-oriented question: could a musical interface rely less on the precise finger actions used by keys, strings, and other conventional controls?</p>
        <p class="design-role">I developed the concept and led the research, project management, testing, and presentation, while also contributing hands-on across the build with the rest of the team.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="design-hero-image"><img src="/assets/projects/design-day/design-day-hero-prototype.webp" width="1200" height="1600" alt="The final circular light-based electronic musical instrument with illuminated interaction points arranged around its rim." /><figcaption>The final circular light-based instrument built for uOttawa Design Day.</figcaption></figure>
    </header>

    <section class="design-section design-result" aria-labelledby="result-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Result</p><h2 id="result-title">A working team build, recognized at Design Day</h2></div>
      <p><strong>Beam Buccaneers — Open 1 winner, uOttawa Design Day Winter 2023.</strong> <a href="https://www.uottawa.ca/faculty-engineering/centre-entrepreneurship-engineering-design/past-winners">uOttawa’s past-winners listing</a> names the team and result.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="design-section" aria-labelledby="inspiration-title">
      <div class="design-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Origin</p><h2 id="inspiration-title">Inspiration became a different physical instrument</h2></div>
      <div class="design-two-col">
        <figure class="design-figure"><img src="/assets/projects/design-day/design-day-museum-reference.jpg" width="1480" height="1200" alt="A transparent pink laser harp on display at the Canada Science and Technology Museum." /><figcaption>Museum inspiration / reference — not our prototype.</figcaption></figure>
        <div class="design-reading"><p>The idea began after I saw a laser harp at the Canada Science and Technology Museum. Our team did not reproduce that object. We translated the interaction prompt into a circular, light-based electronic musical instrument for the competition.</p><p>The design rationale was exploratory: could changing the input method make musical interaction less dependent on fine-motor precision? Accessibility guided the concept; it was not an experimentally validated outcome.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="design-section design-demo" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
      <div class="design-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Working demo</p><h2 id="demo-title">See the interaction and hear the real instrument</h2></div>
      <div class="design-demo-grid">
        <video class="design-video" controls width="480" height="848" preload="metadata" aria-describedby="design-demo-description" poster="/assets/projects/design-day/design-day-demo-poster.jpg" aria-label="Working demonstration of the final circular instrument with real instrument audio.">
          <source src="/assets/projects/design-day/design-day-working-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser does not support the working demonstration video.
        </video>
        <div class="design-reading" id="design-demo-description"><p>The video shows a hand moving around the circular rim and engaging illuminated interaction points. Each interaction is handled by electronic control logic and produces synthesized sound. The audio is the actual sound from the functioning instrument.</p><p>Use the player’s controls to play, pause, or adjust the sound.</p></div>
      </div>
      <ol class="design-mechanism" aria-label="Interaction mechanism"><li>Illuminated interaction points</li><li>Electronic control logic</li><li>Synthesized sound</li></ol>
    </section>

    <section class="design-section" aria-labelledby="build-title">
      <div class="design-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Build</p><h2 id="build-title">From fabrication to a playable prototype</h2></div>
      <div class="design-reading design-reading-wide"><p>The team moved through printed components, electronics work, physical assembly, and bench testing before bringing the circular instrument together. I contributed hands-on across the build alongside teammates with different technical strengths.</p></div>
      <div class="design-gallery">{processImages.map((image) => <figure><img src={image.src} width={image.width} height={image.height} alt={image.alt} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>{image.caption}</figcaption></figure>)}</div>
    </section>

    <section class="design-section design-test" aria-labelledby="test-title">
      <div class="design-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Informal testing</p><h2 id="test-title">Put the working interaction in people’s hands</h2></div>
      <div class="design-reading"><p>We informally put the working instrument in front of roughly five people, including about three musicians, and asked them to play notes, try a melody, and interact freely. The sessions were exploratory rather than a formal usability study and did not produce a recurring issue that drove a redesign.</p><p>Built with Beam Buccaneers teammates Stefano Heguy, Arian Shaafi, and Eric Steve Tessac Teutu.</p></div>
    </section>
  </article>
  <ContactBand />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .design-case { max-width: var(--content-main); margin-inline: auto; padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 2.25rem) clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .design-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(18rem, .8fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5.5rem); align-items: center; padding-bottom: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .design-meta { margin: 0 0 1.2rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 760; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .design-hero h1 { margin: 0; max-width: 48rem; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6.5vw, 6rem); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .design-lede { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; color: var(--color-text); font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.6vw, 1.3rem); line-height: 1.55; }
  .design-role { margin: 1.2rem 0 0; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .design-hero-image, .design-figure, .design-gallery figure { margin: 0; }
  .design-hero-image { padding: .65rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-media); }
  .design-hero-image img, .design-figure img, .design-gallery img, .design-video { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  figcaption { margin-top: .65rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .design-section { padding-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .design-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 2rem; align-items: start; }
  .design-heading .eyebrow { margin: .5rem 0 0; }
  .design-heading h2, .design-result h2 { max-width: 46rem; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 4.2rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.052em; }
  .design-result { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(18rem, .9fr); gap: 2.5rem; padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem); background: var(--color-pale-teal); }
  .design-result .eyebrow { margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  .design-result p { align-self: end; margin: 0; color: var(--color-text); font-size: 1.03rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .design-result a { color: var(--color-deep-teal); font-weight: 760; text-underline-offset: .18em; }
  .design-two-col, .design-demo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); align-items: start; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .design-figure { padding: .55rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); background: var(--color-surface); }
  .design-reading { max-width: var(--content-reading); color: var(--color-text); }
  .design-reading p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .design-reading p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .design-video { aspect-ratio: 480 / 848; max-height: 43rem; background: #111; }
  .design-mechanism { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .7rem 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .design-mechanism li { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 780; }
  .design-mechanism li:not(:last-child)::after { content: '→'; color: var(--color-teal); }
  .design-reading-wide { max-width: var(--content-reading); margin: 1.7rem 0 0 auto; }
  .design-gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr .72fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; align-items: start; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .design-gallery figure { padding: .45rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); background: var(--color-surface); }
  .design-gallery figure:nth-child(2) img { max-height: 31rem; object-fit: cover; }
  .design-test { padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); background: var(--color-deep-teal); color: white; }
  .design-test .eyebrow { color: #9bd7d0; }
  .design-test .design-heading h2, .design-test .design-reading { color: white; }
  .design-test .design-reading { color: #dbe9e7; margin: 1.5rem 0 0 auto; }
  @media (max-width: 51.25rem) { .design-hero, .design-result, .design-heading, .design-two-col, .design-demo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .design-heading .eyebrow { margin: 0; } .design-hero-image { max-width: 35rem; } .design-gallery { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .design-reading-wide, .design-test .design-reading { margin-left: 0; } }
  @media (max-width: 35rem) { .design-case { padding-inline: 1.125rem; } .design-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 15vw, 4.25rem); } .design-gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .design-mechanism { display: grid; gap: .6rem; } .design-mechanism li:not(:last-child)::after { content: none; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .design-video { transition-duration: .001ms !important; animation-duration: .001ms !important; } }
</style>
